{"strongs": "H5692", "word": "עֻגָה", "translit": "ug.gah", "root": "עוג", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "disc or cake of bread", "definition": "עֻגָה noun feminine disc or cake of bread ; — absolute ׳ ע Hos 7:8 ; 1Kgs 17:13 , construct עֻגַת 1Kgs 19:6 ; Ezek 4:12 plural עֻגוֺת Gen 18:6 ; Num 11:8 construct עֻגֹת Exod 12:39 — bread-cake , made of קֶמַח סֹלֶת Gen 18:6 ( J ), of קֶמַח 1Kgs 17:13 , of manna Num 11:8 ( J E ; verb בִּשֵּׁל ), of barley Ezek 41:2 (simile); unleavened, עֻגֹת מַצּוֺת Exod 12:39 ( E ; verb אָפָת ); רְצָפִים ׳ ע 1Kgs 19:6 cake of hot-stones i.e. baked on them; metaphor כְּלִי הֲפוּכָה ׳ ע Hos 7:8 Ehpraimitic source is a cake not turned (i.e. burnt, ruined). — On ׳ ע see Benz Archaeology 85 f. Now Archaeology i. 111 Kennedy Ency. Bib. BREAD and synonyms , Ib. CAKE .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5850')\">BDB5850</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5692')\">H5692</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5849')\">BDB5849</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5851')\">BDB5851</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עֻגָה</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>disc or cake of bread</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:8\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,8)\">Hos 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,13)\">1Kgs 17:13</ref>, construct <bdbheb>עֻגַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:6\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,6)\">1Kgs 19:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,12)\">Ezek 4:12</ref> plural <bdbheb>עֻגוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 18:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,18,6)\">Gen 18:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 11:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\"